    "text": "Since, the wavelength observed is more than the true wavelength, we can say that the galaxy is receding. Doppler effect in this case gives us<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>λ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mtext>c</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>706</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>656</mtext> <msqrt> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>c</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>v</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>c</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>v</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br />or,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>c</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mtext>706</mtext><mtext>656</mtext></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>1.16</mtext></math><br />or,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.16</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.16</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.16</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.0</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.16</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.22</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvarian